{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grammar Grind is a relaxing word building incremental all about scoring big and flexing your vocabulary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/9804b38105416abf96cef2a9685af83c.poster.avif?t=1774219654\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/9804b38105416abf96cef2a9685af83c.webm?t=1774219654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/9804b38105416abf96cef2a9685af83c.mp4?t=1774219654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Goal is Simple:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Tiles to spell valid Words and earn Score based on the value of the Tiles used. Earn more points for using special Tiles. Unlock &amp; upgrade even more special Tiles by spending the points you earned and then spell even more words! Repay your 1,000,000,000 point debt by playing massive words with huge bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 148,000 English words supported!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Special Tiles with unique interactions and abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable Interest Rate!*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 Upgrades to purchase!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Interest Rate can be improved with upgrades!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take it slow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no reason to stress when you are building Words.  Have some tea. Enjoy the music, or put on a podcast. You can take as long as you need here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/d1ba40419ea1cd1da253c0f4460ead07.avif?t=1774219654\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introducing BankMart!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wish you had a vowel? Need just a little something to kick your next word over the edge? BankMart has you covered. For just a little bit of debt, you can have just the piece you need right now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Debt Paid (Common)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/f95fc72e150b00f1480bf061bb6ffe3f9036e436.jpg"},{"name":"Debt Paid (Uncommon)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/b32a164b539707b7a6801caaa23ad971514d9d31.jpg"},{"name":"Debt Paid (Rare)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/5cf5e5b0168ed6741258bc73a7d741946cb9cdcc.jpg"},{"name":"Debt Paid (Epic)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/2fe355acff4bb659d62a14d69739ea69b65f7fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Debt Paid (Masterwork)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/d060ca7ba9b720968ce373cbc676e4acdb6e050a.jpg"},{"name":"Debt Paid (Legendary)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/0e37123af00cf23a38f694e772f82c1084dab5b6.jpg"},{"name":"Crab In A Bucket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/3d7dcd2325ab325f11a2da7a5e7334cdc1be4ef0.jpg"},{"name":"Upgraded (Common)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/46bd285a98b9636fb02886e30cff46b6cbf4f068.jpg"},{"name":"Upgraded (Uncommon)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055870/8d22ec3cc38c39aecbb7f63032ed5e6612d7c845.jpg"},{"name":"Upgraded (Rare)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity